Original game: "BAS" (B.A.S., Birds and Saws) by yokoboko, a PICO-8 cart
  https://www.lexaloffle.com/bbs/?tid=54986  (cart #bas-9)
  https://github.com/yokoboko/bas-pico-8
  Licence: Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Changes: the cart's Lua was translated to C++ for the CHGame handheld, and
its sprites, map and sound were converted to CHGame's formats
(src/assets, src/audio, generated from assets/bas.p8). Controls, saving
and the pause menu were adapted to CHGame. Bas/NOTES.md lists the details.

Under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 these game parts of the port (Game.*,
src/assets, src/audio, docs/cart.png) are licensed under the same licence:
you may share and adapt them for non-commercial purposes only, crediting
yokoboko, linking the licence, saying what you changed, and sharing your
changes under the same licence. Keep this notice with them.

The port's framework (Fix.*, P8.*, the tools) comes from Cheleste
(github.com/bateske/CHeleste, MIT: ../LICENSE), and the CHGame libraries
are their own projects' (chgame/ and its licences).

The original cart (assets/bas.p8) is not included in this repository:
get it from the link above to rebuild the generated files (BUILDING.md).
